{"id": "reasoning-e01", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "easy", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "已知公式 n=1000*Vc/(π*D)。某立铣刀直径 D=16 mm，推荐切削速度 Vc=120 m/min。只计算主轴转速 n，单位 r/min，结果保留 1 位小数，不要输出其他量。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 256, "tags": ["reasoning", "cutting-speed"], "gold": {"answer": "n = 1000*120/(π*16) = 120000/50.2654824 = 2387.3 r/min", "derivation": "n=1000*Vc/(π*D)=1000*120/(3.14159265*16)=120000/50.2654824=2387.3241 r/min，按题干要求保留 1 位小数为 2387.3；tol_abs=0.05 用于覆盖末位四舍五入的 ±0.05"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 2387.3, "tol_abs": 0.05, "weight": 3, "key": "rpm_value"}, {"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["r\\s*/\\s*min|rpm|转每分"], "weight": 1, "key": "rpm_unit"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["23.87"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_decimal_shift"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-e02", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "easy", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "已知公式 Vf=f*z*n。每齿进给量 f=0.2 mm/齿，刀具齿数 z=4，主轴转速 n=1500 r/min。只计算每分钟进给量 Vf，单位 mm/min，保留 1 位小数。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 256, "tags": ["reasoning", "feed-rate"], "gold": {"answer": "Vf = f*z*n = 0.2*4*1500 = 1200.0 mm/min", "derivation": "Vf=0.2*4*1500=1200 mm/min 精确值；tol_abs=0.5 覆盖保留 1 位小数的表示误差 ±0.05 与单位换算无风险，给 0.5 足够宽松但远小于任何量级错误"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 1200.0, "tol_abs": 0.5, "weight": 3, "key": "vf_value"}, {"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["mm\\s*/\\s*min|毫米每分"], "weight": 1, "key": "vf_unit"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["12000"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_decimal_shift"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-e03", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "easy", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "已知材料去除率公式 MRR=ap*ae*Vf（单位 mm³/min）。背吃刀量 ap=2 mm，铣削宽度 ae=5 mm，进给速度 Vf=800 mm/min。只计算 MRR，保留 1 位小数。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 256, "tags": ["reasoning", "mrr"], "gold": {"answer": "MRR = ap*ae*Vf = 2*5*800 = 8000.0 mm³/min", "derivation": "MRR=2*5*800=8000 mm³/min 精确值；tol_abs=1.0 覆盖保留 1 位小数的 ±0.05 表示误差"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 8000.0, "tol_abs": 1.0, "weight": 3, "key": "mrr_value"}, {"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["mm\\s*(3|\\^?3|/min)"], "weight": 1, "key": "mrr_unit"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["80000"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_decimal_shift"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-e04", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "easy", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "一条直线铣削行程长度 L=720 mm，进给速度 Vf=240 mm/min。按公式 T=L/Vf 计算走刀时间，单位 min，保留 2 位小数。不要换算成秒。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 256, "tags": ["reasoning", "machining-time"], "gold": {"answer": "T = L/Vf = 720/240 = 3.00 min", "derivation": "T=720/240=3.00 min 精确值；tol_abs=0.01 覆盖保留 2 位小数的末位 ±0.005；literal_none 排除把除法写反得到的 0.33"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 3.0, "tol_abs": 0.01, "weight": 3, "key": "time_value"}, {"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["min|分钟"], "weight": 1, "key": "time_unit"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["0.33"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_inverted_division"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-e05", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "easy", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "英制图纸标注板厚 3/8 英寸。按 1 英寸=25.4 mm（精确值）换算成毫米，保留 3 位小数，只回答这一个数。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 256, "tags": ["reasoning", "unit-conversion"], "gold": {"answer": "3/8 英寸 = 0.375 英寸 = 0.375*25.4 = 9.525 mm", "derivation": "0.375*25.4=9.525 mm 精确值；tol_abs=0.005 覆盖保留 3 位小数以及先除后乘的中间舍入（如 25.4/8=3.175 再乘 3 亦得 9.525）"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 9.525, "tol_abs": 0.005, "weight": 3, "key": "mm_value"}, {"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["mm|毫米"], "weight": 1, "key": "mm_unit"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["76.2"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_wrong_fraction"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-e06", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "easy", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "液压夹具压强 p=25 MPa，有效压紧面积 A=400 mm²。利用 1 MPa=1 N/mm² 求压紧力，单位 kN，保留 1 位小数。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 256, "tags": ["reasoning", "unit-conversion", "force"], "gold": {"answer": "F = p*A = 25 N/mm² * 400 mm² = 10000 N = 10.0 kN", "derivation": "F=p*A，1 MPa=1 N/mm²，故 25*400=10000 N=10 kN 精确值；tol_abs=0.05 覆盖保留 1 位小数；literal_none 排除少一个零/多一个零的 100000 kN 类错答"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 10.0, "tol_abs": 0.05, "weight": 3, "key": "force_kn"}, {"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["kN|千牛"], "weight": 1, "key": "force_unit"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["100000"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_order_error"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-e07", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "easy", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "球头铣刀半径 R=5 mm，行距（相邻两刀中心距）s=6 mm。残留高度公式 h=R-sqrt(R²-(s/2)²)。只计算残留高度 h，单位 mm，保留 3 位小数。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 256, "tags": ["reasoning", "scallop-height"], "gold": {"answer": "h = 5-sqrt(5²-3²) = 5-sqrt(25-9) = 5-4 = 1.000 mm", "derivation": "s/2=3；R²-(s/2)²=25-9=16；sqrt(16)=4；h=5-4=1 mm 精确值；tol_abs=0.005 覆盖保留 3 位小数；literal_none 排除量级错答"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 1.0, "tol_abs": 0.005, "weight": 3, "key": "scallop_value"}, {"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["mm|毫米"], "weight": 1, "key": "scallop_unit"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["0.100", "10.000"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_wrong_magnitude"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-e08", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "easy", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "法兰的分度圆直径 Ø160 mm，均布 6 个孔。弦长公式 = D*sin(180°/z)。求相邻两孔的孔心距（mm，保留 1 位小数）与相邻孔的角向间隔（度）。用阿拉伯数字作答。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 256, "tags": ["reasoning", "bolt-circle"], "gold": {"answer": "角向间隔 = 360/6 = 60 度；孔心距 = 160*sin(30°) = 160*0.5 = 80.0 mm", "derivation": "2R*sin(180/6)=2*80*sin(30°)=160*0.5=80 mm 精确值（正六边形边长等于半径）；角向间隔=360/6=60°；tol_abs 分别取 0.05 与 0.5 覆盖小数位舍入；literal_none 排除按 4 孔算出的 113.1"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 80.0, "tol_abs": 0.05, "weight": 3, "key": "chord_value"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 60.0, "tol_abs": 0.5, "weight": 2, "key": "angular_pitch"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["113.1"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_wrong_hole_count"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-e09", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "easy", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "两把刀具的寿命达标事件相互独立，达标概率分别为 0.90 和 0.80。求两把刀具同时达标的概率，保留 3 位小数。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 256, "tags": ["reasoning", "probability"], "gold": {"answer": "P = 0.90*0.80 = 0.720", "derivation": "独立事件同时发生 P=P1*P2=0.90*0.80=0.72 精确值；tol_abs=0.005 覆盖保留 3 位小数；literal_none 排除把独立事件当并集算出的 0.98"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.72, "tol_abs": 0.005, "weight": 3, "key": "probability_value"}, {"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["P\\s*=|概率"], "weight": 1, "key": "shows_probability"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["0.98"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_union_error"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m01", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "铣削 Ø10 mm、3 齿立铣刀，Vc=200 m/min，每齿进给 f=0.15 mm/齿。按 n=1000*Vc/(π*D) 先算主轴转速并四舍五入到整数，再以取整后的 n 代入 Vf=f*z*n。按顺序给出 n（r/min）与 Vf（mm/min，保留 1 位小数）。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "cutting-speed", "feed-rate"], "gold": {"answer": "n = 1000*200/(π*10) = 6366.1977 → 取整 6366 r/min；Vf = 0.15*3*6366 = 2864.7 mm/min", "derivation": "n=200000/31.4159265=6366.1977，按题干取整为 6366；Vf=0.15*3*6366=2864.7 mm/min 精确值；tol_abs(n)=1 覆盖 6366/6366.2 两种表述，tol_abs(Vf)=0.3 覆盖用未取整 n 计算得到的 2864.79（差 0.09）"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 6366, "tol_abs": 1.0, "weight": 2, "key": "rpm_value"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 2864.7, "tol_abs": 0.3, "weight": 3, "key": "vf_value"}, {"type": "ordered_contains", "sequence": ["6366", "2864.7"], "weight": 1, "key": "chain_order"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m02", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "FANUC 程序片段（单位 mm）：N10 G90 X100.0 Y50.0；N20 G91 X10.0 Y-5.0；N30 G90 X80.0 Y60.0；N40 G91 X5.0；N50 G91 Y-10.0。G90 为绝对编程、G91 为增量编程且模态有效。求执行完 N50 时刀具的绝对坐标，只输出 X、Y 两个数（保留 1 位小数）。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "gcode-logic"], "gold": {"answer": "N10 → X100.0 Y50.0；N20 增量 → X110.0 Y45.0；N30 绝对 → X80.0 Y60.0；N40 增量 X5.0 → X85.0 Y60.0；N50 增量 Y-10.0 → 最终绝对坐标 X85.0 Y50.0", "derivation": "G91 段是在当前点上加减：100+10=110、50-5=45；G90 段直接改写为目标值 80/60；末两段增量 80+5=85、60-10=50。最终 X85.0 Y50.0 精确；tol_abs=0.05 只容许 1 位小数舍入"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 85.0, "tol_abs": 0.05, "weight": 3, "key": "final_x"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 50.0, "tol_abs": 0.05, "weight": 3, "key": "final_y"}, {"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["X\\s*85"], "weight": 1, "key": "labeled_x"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m03", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "编程轮廓（单位 mm）：从 (0,0) 沿 G01 走到 (20,0)，再沿 G01 走到 (20,10)。使用 G41 左刀补（沿走刀方向看，刀具中心在轮廓左侧），补偿号 D01 存储值为 4.0。求两段偏置直线的交点（即刀心经过的拐角点）坐标，保留 1 位小数。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "cutter-compensation"], "gold": {"answer": "第一段方向 +X，左侧法向为 +Y，刀心线为 y=4.0；第二段方向 +Y，左侧法向为 -X，刀心线为 x=20-4=16.0；交点为 X16.0 Y4.0", "derivation": "左刀补偿把刀心沿走刀方向左侧移动 D 值 4.0 mm：段1 偏置线 y=+4.0，段2 偏置线 x=20-4.0=16.0，交点 (16,4) 精确；tol_abs=0.05 覆盖 1 位小数；literal_none 排除把 G41 当右补得到的 (24,4)/(16,-4) 类错答"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 16.0, "tol_abs": 0.05, "weight": 3, "key": "corner_x"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 4.0, "tol_abs": 0.05, "weight": 2, "key": "corner_y"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["24.0, 4.0", "24.0 Y4.0"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_wrong_side"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m04", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "三层板叠装，厚度名义值与公差（mm）：t1=10±0.20，t2=20±0.10，t3=5±0.05。按极值法（最坏情况）求叠总厚的最大极限尺寸、最小极限尺寸和公差带宽度，各保留 2 位小数。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "tolerance-stack"], "gold": {"answer": "名义尺寸 = 10+20+5 = 35 mm；最大极限 = 35+0.35 = 35.35 mm；最小极限 = 35-0.35 = 34.65 mm；公差带宽度 = 35.35-34.65 = 0.70 mm", "derivation": "极值法：封闭环公差 = 各组成环公差之和 = 0.20+0.10+0.05 = 0.35（单边），双侧带宽 2*0.35=0.70；最大 35.35、最小 34.65 均为精确值；tol_abs=0.005 覆盖保留 2 位小数"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 35.35, "tol_abs": 0.005, "weight": 3, "key": "max_limit"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 34.65, "tol_abs": 0.005, "weight": 3, "key": "min_limit"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.70, "tol_abs": 0.005, "weight": 2, "key": "total_tol"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m05", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "尺寸链组成环公差（单边值，mm）：0.20、0.10、0.05。按统计法 RSS = sqrt(0.20^2+0.10^2+0.05^2) 求合成单边公差（保留 3 位小数），并写出根号内的和。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "tolerance-stack", "rss"], "gold": {"answer": "根号内之和 = 0.0400+0.0100+0.0025 = 0.0525；RSS = sqrt(0.0525) = 0.229 mm", "derivation": "RSS=sqrt(0.2^2+0.1^2+0.05^2)=sqrt(0.0525)=0.2291288 mm，保留 3 位小数为 0.229；tol_abs=0.002 覆盖末位舍入；中间量 0.0525 精确，tol_abs=0.0005"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.229, "tol_abs": 0.002, "weight": 3, "key": "rss_value"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.0525, "tol_abs": 0.0005, "weight": 1, "key": "sum_of_squares"}, {"type": "literal_any", "values": ["RSS", "均方根", "统计法"], "weight": 1, "key": "method_named"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m06", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "图样给定（单位 mm，一切以图样给定数值为准）：孔 Ø30 上偏差 +0.021、下偏差 0；轴 Ø30 上偏差 -0.007、下偏差 -0.020（标注形式为 Ø30 H7/g6）。求最大间隙与最小间隙（保留 3 位小数），并判定该配合属于间隙配合、过渡配合还是过盈配合。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "fits", "tolerance"], "gold": {"answer": "最大间隙 = 孔上偏差 - 轴下偏差 = 0.021-(-0.020) = 0.041 mm；最小间隙 = 孔下偏差 - 轴上偏差 = 0-(-0.007) = 0.007 mm；最小间隙 0.007 mm 大于 0 → 间隙配合", "derivation": "间隙配合：Xmax=ES-ei=0.021+0.020=0.041 mm；Xmin=EI-es=0+0.007=0.007 mm；两值均为给定偏差的直接算术和，精确；tol_abs=0.0005 覆盖保留 3 位小数"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.041, "tol_abs": 0.0005, "weight": 3, "key": "max_clearance"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.007, "tol_abs": 0.0005, "weight": 2, "key": "min_clearance"}, {"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["间隙配合"], "weight": 2, "key": "fit_class"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m07", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "莫氏类外圆锥：大端直径 D=50 mm，小端直径 d=40 mm，锥长 L=45 mm。按 tan(α/2)=(D-d)/(2L) 求半锥角 α/2（度，保留 2 位小数）与全锥角 α（度，保留 2 位小数）。先答半锥角再答全锥角。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "taper-angle"], "gold": {"answer": "tan(α/2)=(50-40)/(2*45)=10/90=0.111111；α/2=atan(0.111111)=6.34 度；α=2*6.34=12.68 度", "derivation": "tan(α/2)=0.1111111 → α/2=6.340192° → α=12.680383°；保留 2 位小数为 6.34 与 12.68；tol_abs=0.01 覆盖末位舍入；literal_none 排除把锥度 1:9 的比值 0.111 误当成角度"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 6.34, "tol_abs": 0.01, "weight": 3, "key": "half_angle"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 12.68, "tol_abs": 0.01, "weight": 2, "key": "full_angle"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["6.34 rad"], "weight": 1, "key": "degree_not_radian"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m08", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "轮廓在角点 (60,0) 处由水平边（沿 y=0 向左延伸）与垂直边（沿 x=60 向上延伸）相交。用 R15 圆角与两条边相切过渡。求圆角弧圆心的坐标，以及圆角与水平边 y=0 的切点坐标（保留 1 位小数）。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "fillet-geometry"], "gold": {"answer": "圆心到两边距离均为 15，故圆心 X=60-15=45.0、Y=0+15=15.0，即 (45.0, 15.0)；与水平边 y=0 的切点为 (45.0, 0.0)", "derivation": "两直角边为 y=0 与 x=60，内切圆心在角点内侧：X=60-15=45、Y=0+15=15；切点在圆心正下方 (45,0)。数值精确；tol_abs=0.05；literal_none 排除把圆心算到角点外侧 (75,15) 的符号错误"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 45.0, "tol_abs": 0.05, "weight": 3, "key": "center_x"}, {"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["45(?:\\.\\d+)?\\s*[,，]\\s*15(?:\\.\\d+)?"], "weight": 2, "key": "center_pair"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["75"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_outward_offset"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m09", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "型腔分层铣削：总切深 10 mm，每层背吃刀量 2 mm（层数按向上取整）；每层有效切削长度 250 mm，每层另有进刀与退刀空行程合计 50 mm；进给速度 Vf=300 mm/min。求层数、总走刀行程与工序时间（min，保留 2 位小数）。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "machining-time", "multi-pass"], "gold": {"answer": "层数 = ceil(10/2) = 5 层；每层行程 = 250+50 = 300 mm；总行程 = 5*300 = 1500 mm；工序时间 = 1500/300 = 5.00 min", "derivation": "层数=10/2=5（整除）；单层行程=250+50=300 mm；总行程=5*300=1500 mm；T=1500/300=5.00 min 精确；tol_abs 时间 0.01、行程 1 覆盖舍入；literal_none 排除漏算空行程得到的 4.17"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 1500, "tol_abs": 1.0, "weight": 2, "key": "total_travel"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 5.0, "tol_abs": 0.01, "weight": 3, "key": "time_value"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["4.17"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_missing_travel"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m10", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "程序段：G03 X30.0 Y10.0 I10.0 J0.0，执行该段前刀具位于 (10.0,10.0)，单位 mm。I、J 为从弧段起点指向圆心的矢量分量。求弧段半径（mm，保留 1 位小数）、圆心角（度）与弧长（mm，保留 2 位小数）。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "gcode-arc"], "gold": {"answer": "圆心 = (10+10, 10+0) = (20.0, 10.0)；半径 R=sqrt(10²+0²)=10.0 mm；起点在圆心左侧 180 度方向、终点在右侧 0 度方向，圆心角 = 180 度；弧长 = π*R = 3.14159265*10 = 31.42 mm", "derivation": "半径=sqrt(I²+J²)=sqrt(100)=10 mm；I、J 与终点对称说明半圆弧 → 圆心角 180°；弧长=R*θ(rad)=10*π=31.4159 mm → 31.42；tol_abs 弧长 0.02 覆盖 31.416/31.42，圆心角 tol_abs=0.5"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 31.42, "tol_abs": 0.02, "weight": 3, "key": "arc_length"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 180, "tol_abs": 0.5, "weight": 2, "key": "sweep_angle"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 20.0, "tol_abs": 0.05, "weight": 1, "key": "center_x"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m11", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "英制图纸标注矩形板 12.500 英寸 × 4.250 英寸。按 1 英寸=25.4 mm 先把两条边分别换算成毫米，再计算面积（mm²，保留 1 位小数）。禁止先用英寸算面积再换算。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "unit-conversion", "area"], "gold": {"answer": "12.500 英寸 = 317.5 mm；4.250 英寸 = 107.95 mm；面积 = 317.5*107.95 = 34274.1 mm²", "derivation": "317.5*107.95=34274.125 mm²，保留 1 位小数为 34274.1；边长换算为精确值 317.5 与 107.95；tol_abs 面积 0.2、短边 0.01 覆盖末位舍入；literal_none 排除先算 53.125 in² 再乘 25.4 得到的 1349"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 34274.1, "tol_abs": 0.2, "weight": 3, "key": "area_mm2"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 107.95, "tol_abs": 0.01, "weight": 2, "key": "short_edge_mm"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["1349"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_wrong_conversion_order"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m12", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "工序 A、B、C、D、E、F 各排一次，约束为：A 必须在 B 之前；B 必须在 C 之前；B 必须在 D 之前；D 必须在 E 之前；C 必须在 F 之前；E 必须在 F 之前。问 F 只能排在第几位、B 最早可排在第几位。用阿拉伯数字回答，先答 F 再答 B。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "logic-ordering"], "gold": {"answer": "F 的前序是 C 与 E，而 C、E 又都在 B 之后、B 在 A 之后，所以 A、B、C、D、E 全部必须先于 F，F 只能排第 6 位；B 之前必须有 A，故 B 最早排第 2 位", "derivation": "拓扑排序：A→B→{C,D→E}→F，F 是所有链的汇点 → 唯一位次 6；B 只有前驱 A → 最早位次 2；tol_abs=0 要求整数完全一致"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 6, "tol_abs": 0, "weight": 3, "key": "f_position"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 2, "tol_abs": 0, "weight": 2, "key": "b_earliest"}, {"type": "ordered_contains", "sequence": ["6", "2"], "weight": 1, "key": "answer_order"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m13", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "一批 10 件中有 3 件不合格。不放回地随机抽 2 件，用组合数 C(n,k) 计算两件都合格的概率（保留 4 位小数）。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "probability", "sampling"], "gold": {"answer": "合格件数 = 10-3 = 7；P = C(7,2)/C(10,2) = 21/45 = 0.4667", "derivation": "C(7,2)=21、C(10,2)=45，P=21/45=0.4666667 → 保留 4 位小数 0.4667；tol_abs=0.0002 覆盖末位舍入；组合数 21 精确（tol_abs=0）；literal_none 排除有放回近似 0.7²=0.49"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.4667, "tol_abs": 0.0002, "weight": 3, "key": "probability_value"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 21, "tol_abs": 0, "weight": 1, "key": "favorable_count"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["0.49"], "weight": 2, "key": "no_with_replacement"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m14", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "图样：孔 Ø10 上偏差 +0.020、下偏差 0；位置度公差 Ø0.05，标注了最大实体要求（MMC 符号 M 圈）。实测孔径为 Ø10.020。求最大实体补偿量与此时允许的位置度公差（各保留 3 位小数）。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "mmc-bonus-tolerance"], "gold": {"answer": "MMC 实体尺寸 = Ø10.000；补偿量 = 10.020-10.000 = 0.020 mm；允许位置度 = 0.050+0.020 = 0.070 mm", "derivation": "最大实体要求下补偿量=实际尺寸-MMC 尺寸=10.020-10.000=0.020 mm；允许公差=给定公差+补偿=0.050+0.020=0.070 mm；均为给定值的精确算术差；tol_abs=0.0005 覆盖保留 3 位小数"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.070, "tol_abs": 0.0005, "weight": 3, "key": "allowed_position_tol"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.020, "tol_abs": 0.0005, "weight": 2, "key": "bonus_value"}, {"type": "literal_any", "values": ["MMC", "最大实体"], "weight": 1, "key": "method_named"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-m15", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "球头铣刀半径 R=5 mm，要求残留高度不超过 0.05 mm。按行距公式 s=2*sqrt(2*R*h-h²) 求允许的最大行距 s（mm，保留 2 位小数），并写出根号内的数值。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 448, "tags": ["reasoning", "scallop-height", "stepover"], "gold": {"answer": "根号内 = 2*5*0.05-0.05² = 0.5-0.0025 = 0.4975；s = 2*sqrt(0.4975) = 2*0.70534 = 1.41 mm", "derivation": "2Rh-h²=0.4975（精确）；sqrt(0.4975)=0.705337；s=1.410674 mm → 保留 2 位小数 1.41；tol_abs=0.01 覆盖末位舍入与 0.4975 的开方精度"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 1.41, "tol_abs": 0.01, "weight": 3, "key": "stepover_value"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.4975, "tol_abs": 0.0005, "weight": 1, "key": "inner_term"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["14.1"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_decimal_shift"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-h01", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "hard", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "粗铣平面工艺链：刀具 Ø12 mm、齿数 z=4，Vc=180 m/min，每齿进给 f=0.15 mm/齿，ap=3 mm，ae=10 mm；单次走刀覆盖长度 480 mm，每层另加引入与切出空行程 20 mm，共 2 层。公式：n=1000*Vc/(π*D)，Vf=f*z*n，MRR=ap*ae*Vf，T=总行程/Vf。中间量一律不取整，最终 n、Vf 各保留 1 位小数，MRR 保留 1 位小数（mm³/min），时间保留 2 位小数（单位 s）。按 n、Vf、MRR、时间的顺序输出。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 704, "tags": ["reasoning", "cutting-chain", "mrr", "machining-time"], "gold": {"answer": "n = 1000*180/(π*12) = 4774.6 r/min；Vf = 0.15*4*n = 2864.8 mm/min；MRR = 3*10*Vf = 85943.7 mm³/min；总行程 = 2*(480+20) = 1000 mm；T = 1000/2864.789 = 0.349066 min = 20.94 s", "derivation": "n=180000/37.6991118=4774.64829；Vf=0.6*4774.64829=2864.78898→2864.8；MRR=30*2864.78898=85943.669→85943.7；总行程=2*500=1000 mm；T=1000/2864.78898=0.3490659 min，乘 60 得 20.94395 s→20.94 s。tol_abs：n 0.5 覆盖 4774.6/4774.65；Vf 0.2 覆盖取整 n 传下来的 2864.76；MRR 30 覆盖 85942.8~85944；时间 0.05 覆盖 20.94/20.944"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 4774.6, "tol_abs": 0.5, "weight": 2, "key": "rpm_value"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 2864.8, "tol_abs": 0.2, "weight": 2, "key": "vf_value"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 85943.7, "tol_abs": 30, "weight": 2, "key": "mrr_value"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 20.94, "tol_abs": 0.05, "weight": 3, "key": "time_seconds"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-h02", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "hard", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "四层垫片叠装（单位 mm）：t1=10±0.15，t2=8±0.05，t3=6±0.05，t4=4±0.10。装配总厚的图纸要求是 28±0.30 mm。分别用极值法与 RSS 统计法求合成公差的单边值（保留 3 位小数），并逐条判定两种方法下该装配要求是否满足（必须使用 满足 或 不满足 字样）。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 704, "tags": ["reasoning", "tolerance-stack", "rss", "decision"], "gold": {"answer": "名义总厚 = 10+8+6+4 = 28 mm。极值法单边 = 0.15+0.05+0.05+0.10 = 0.350 mm，0.350 大于 0.300，极值法不满足图纸要求。RSS 单边 = sqrt(0.15^2+0.05^2+0.05^2+0.10^2) = sqrt(0.0225+0.0025+0.0025+0.0100) = sqrt(0.0375) = 0.194 mm，0.194 不大于 0.300，RSS 法满足图纸要求", "derivation": "极值法：各环公差直接相加 0.15+0.05+0.05+0.10=0.35 mm，超出 0.30 → 不满足。RSS：sqrt(0.0225+0.0025+0.0025+0.01)=sqrt(0.0375)=0.1936492 → 0.194 mm ≤ 0.30 → 满足。tol_abs 各 0.001 覆盖保留 3 位小数；判定词用 极值…不满足 与 RSS…满足 两条正则锚定，后者带 (?<!不) 前瞻排除把 不满足 误判成 满足"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.350, "tol_abs": 0.001, "weight": 2, "key": "worst_case_tol"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.194, "tol_abs": 0.001, "weight": 3, "key": "rss_tol"}, {"type": "regex_all", "patterns": ["极值[^。]{0,10}不满足", "RSS[^。]{0,10}(?<!不)满足"], "weight": 2, "key": "verdict_pair"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-h03", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "hard", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "铣一直槽：编程槽宽 20 mm（两条槽壁轮廓分别在 X=0 与 X=20，槽内为空腔，刀心始终偏在轮廓靠槽内一侧），启用刀具半径补偿，补偿号 D02 存储值为 5.0，而实际装夹的立铣刀直径为 8.0 mm。求加工出的实际槽宽（mm，保留 1 位小数），并说明偏宽还是偏窄、补偿值是偏大还是偏小。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 704, "tags": ["reasoning", "cutter-compensation", "trap"], "gold": {"answer": "实际刀具半径 r = 8.0/2 = 4.0 mm，补偿值 C=5.0 mm 偏大 1.0 mm。两条槽壁的刀心线被分别外偏 5.0 而非 4.0，两侧各欠切 1.0 mm，因此实际槽宽 = 20-2*(5.0-4.0) = 18.0 mm，即槽偏窄，原因是半径补偿值大于实际刀具半径导致欠切", "derivation": "刀心距 = 20-2C；实际槽宽 = 刀心距 + 2r = 20-2(C-r) = 20-2*(5-4) = 18 mm 精确。补偿值大于实际半径 → 材料残留 → 槽偏窄；tol_abs=0.05 覆盖 1 位小数；literal_none 排除符号搞反得到的 22.0"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 18.0, "tol_abs": 0.05, "weight": 3, "key": "actual_width"}, {"type": "literal_any", "values": ["偏窄", "欠切", "变小", "不足"], "weight": 2, "key": "direction_flagged"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["22.0"], "weight": 2, "key": "no_sign_error"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-h04", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "hard", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "一维尺寸链：L0=L1-L2-L3（mm）。已知 L1=40±0.10、L2=25±0.05，L3 在图样上只标注了名义尺寸 12 mm 而没有标注公差。要求给出 L0 的公差带宽度。若条件不足请明确指出缺什么，不要假设数值。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 704, "tags": ["reasoning", "tolerance-stack", "missing-datum", "trap"], "gold": {"answer": "无法计算 L0 的公差带宽度：L3 只有名义尺寸 12 mm，图样没有给出 L3 的公差或极限偏差，尺寸链缺少这一数据。名义尺寸可以先算：L0=40-25-12=3 mm。若后续补充了 L3 的公差值 t3，则 L0 的公差带宽度 = 0.20+0.10+2*t3（极值法）。请补充 L3 的上下偏差", "derivation": "极值法下封闭环带宽 = 各组成环带宽之和 = 0.20+0.10+t3 带宽，缺 t3 故不可解；gold 只给出含 t3 的表达式与名义值 3 mm，绝不给出数值化带宽。literal_none 列出三种最可能的臆造值（假设 t3=±0.05→0.70、±0.10→0.80、±0.15→0.90）；regex_any 要求把缺失项点名到 L3"}, "criteria": [{"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["无法计算|条件不足|缺少|不能确定|无法唯一"], "weight": 3, "key": "flags_missing_data"}, {"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["L3[^\\n]{0,60}公差"], "weight": 2, "key": "names_missing_ring"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["0.70", "0.80", "0.90"], "weight": 2, "key": "no_fabricated_value"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-h05", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "hard", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "图样（单位 mm）：孔 Ø20 上偏差 +0.030、下偏差 0；位置度公差 Ø0.10 带最大实体要求（符号 M 圈）。三坐标实测孔径 Ø20.035、实测位置度 Ø0.120。求按最大实体要求可获得的位置度补偿量、此时允许的位置度公差，并给出该零件的最终结论（合格 或 不合格）。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 704, "tags": ["reasoning", "mmc-bonus-tolerance", "trap", "inspection"], "gold": {"answer": "MMC 实体尺寸 = Ø20.000，孔的最大极限尺寸 = Ø20.030。实测 Ø20.035 已超出最大极限尺寸，超出 0.005 mm，因此补偿量只能按尺寸公差封顶计：0.030 mm；允许位置度 = 0.100+0.030 = 0.130 mm，实测位置度 0.120 mm 在这一项内。但尺寸本身已超差 → 该零件不合格", "derivation": "bonus = 实际尺寸-MMC = 20.035-20.000 = 0.035，但可补偿上限受尺寸公差约束为 20.030-20.000 = 0.030 mm（超出即尺寸超差）；允许位置度 = 0.100+0.030 = 0.130 mm；尺寸超差量 = 20.035-20.030 = 0.005 mm。tol_abs 各 0.0005 覆盖保留 3 位小数；literal_none 排除不做封顶直接得 0.135 的算法"}, "criteria": [{"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.130, "tol_abs": 0.0005, "weight": 2, "key": "allowed_position_tol"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 0.005, "tol_abs": 0.0005, "weight": 2, "key": "size_overrun"}, {"type": "regex_any", "patterns": ["不合格"], "weight": 3, "key": "reject_verdict"}, {"type": "literal_none", "values": ["0.135"], "weight": 1, "key": "no_uncapped_bonus"}]}
{"id": "reasoning-h06", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "hard", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "分度圆直径 Ø100 mm（半径 R=50 mm）上均布 6 个孔，第一个孔在 0 度方向（+X 轴），逆时针每 60 度一个。按每行一个孔的格式输出 6 个孔心坐标（写作 X=数值, Y=数值，单位 mm，保留 3 位小数），最后一行给出这 6 点构成的正六边形面积（mm²，保留 1 位小数）。面积公式 = 0.5*n*R²*sin(360°/n)。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 704, "tags": ["reasoning", "bolt-circle", "geometry"], "gold": {"answer": "X=50.000, Y=0.000\nX=25.000, Y=43.301\nX=-25.000, Y=43.301\nX=-50.000, Y=0.000\nX=-25.000, Y=-43.301\nX=25.000, Y=-43.301\n面积 = 0.5*6*50*50*sin(60°) = 7500*0.8660254 = 6495.2 mm²", "derivation": "X_i=50*cos(60i°)，Y_i=50*sin(60i°)：cos60°=0.5 → 25.000；sin60°=0.8660254 → 50*0.8660254=43.30127 → 43.301。面积=0.5*6*2500*0.8660254=6495.19 mm² → 6495.2。tol_abs：43.301 取 0.002、6495.2 取 0.2、-25 取 0.002 覆盖保留位数的舍入"}, "criteria": [{"type": "line_count", "min": 7, "max": 12, "weight": 1, "key": "six_rows_plus_area"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 43.301, "tol_abs": 0.002, "weight": 3, "key": "y_vertex"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": -25.0, "tol_abs": 0.002, "weight": 2, "key": "negative_x_vertex"}, {"type": "numeric_near", "value": 6495.2, "tol_abs": 0.2, "weight": 3, "key": "hexagon_area"}]}
